# Runtime state — never commit spoken content or cached audio.
# The store is named state.db, so *.sqlite* alone did not cover it: a stray
# AI_TTS_HOME pointing inside the checkout would have left a database of
# everything ever spoken stageable by `git add -A`.
/state/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.wav
*.mp3
*.pcm
